01:39:42.400 --> 01:39:47.587
you. So I did six sessions, this would've been —
Kevin Rose: With a mask on and in the music.&nbsp;

01:39:47.587 --> 01:39:51.160
Tim Ferriss: In this particular case it was&nbsp;
music, but it was not mask on. The way that&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:39:51.160 --> 01:39:56.640
this particular clinic ran things was with video,&nbsp;
which was very strange to me. But nonetheless,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:39:56.640 --> 01:40:01.520
it was sort of nature-scapes. And I was like,&nbsp;
