01:40:01.520 --> 01:40:08.600
And it ended up being supremely interesting.&nbsp;
I was not going in with an acute condition,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:40:08.600 --> 01:40:16.520
so it was hard for me to evaluate ultimately a&nbsp;
lot of the efficacy. They found it very strange&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:40:16.520 --> 01:40:21.788
and I found it hilarious because they would&nbsp;
do an intake each day of active sessions.&nbsp;

01:40:21.788 --> 01:40:22.480
Kevin Rose: That's what —
Tim Ferriss: And they would&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:40:22.480 --> 01:40:28.440
ask me to do various assessments for anxiety, and&nbsp;
my anxiety levels were going up over time, which&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:40:28.440 --> 01:40:35.320
they found very confusing, because, you may have&nbsp;
