Kevin Rose: No.&nbsp;

01:45:39.587 --> 01:45:43.760
Tim Ferriss: A very good friend of mine&nbsp;
since we last spoke, Roland Griffiths,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:45:43.760 --> 01:45:50.180
who's an amazing scientist from Johns&nbsp;
Hopkins, he died of terminal cancer.&nbsp;

01:45:50.180 --> 01:45:53.920
Kevin Rose: Oh, Jesus. Sorry, man.
Tim Ferriss: And I had a long conversation&nbsp;&nbsp;

