anyway, long story short, when I was going in, the&nbsp;
anesthesiologist came in the room and he was kind&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:26.120 --> 01:46:29.188
of a funny guy. It was cool. I like those guys.
Tim Ferriss: Yeah.&nbsp;

01:46:29.188 --> 01:46:32.080
Kevin Rose: And I asked him, I said, "Can&nbsp;
I have this slow ramp?" And he is like,&nbsp;&nbsp;

