01:46:34.640 --> 01:46:37.000
just because I feel like going into that zone.”
Tim Ferriss: Yeah.&nbsp;

01:46:37.000 --> 01:46:40.600
Kevin Rose: And he's like, "It's funny you say&nbsp;
that." He's like, "I'm giving you the same drug&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:40.600 --> 01:46:45.520
they gave Michael Jackson when he died." And I&nbsp;
was like, "Oh, that's crazy." I'm like, "Why?" And&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:45.520 --> 01:46:51.040
he's like, "He was just addicted to it." And so he&nbsp;
gave me the slow ramp, and I remember this feeling&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:51.040 --> 01:46:57.840
about probably, let's call it 30 seconds into it,&nbsp;
