And by the way, Tim, if they looked at you through&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:08:34.800 --> 02:08:40.240
the same lens you were looking at them through,&nbsp;
they would decide that you are high maintenance.&nbsp;

02:08:40.240 --> 02:08:46.160
So gather some tools, right? I would say read&nbsp;
The Five Love Languages, as cheesy and schlocky&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:08:46.160 --> 02:08:54.120
as it might seem. That shit is so helpful as&nbsp;
a framework for discussion, for identifying&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:08:54.120 --> 02:09:00.000
and easily labeling the different categories of&nbsp;
needs that people might have and putting them in&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:09:00.000 --> 02:09:04.440
some type of order. Oh, interesting. You're&nbsp;
a quality time person. Good to know. Number&nbsp;&nbsp;

