02:09:31.440 --> 02:09:39.280
commit together to develop a shorthand,&nbsp;
which allows you to not necessarily prevent,&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:09:39.280 --> 02:09:44.200
I don't think prevention is the key. I think&nbsp;
